	(text "VCC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 65.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "08460086-38da-4051-b79e-4444ed6897d8")
	)
	(text "A: mount for one Atlas Electrically Isolated EZO Carrier Board Gen 2, screwed flat on its standoffs (isolation and the probe SMA are on the carrier).\nJ: header for the carrier's 5-wire Dupont cable, in the carrier header's order: VCC, OFF, GND, TX/SDA, RX/SCL.\nSW (one slider, two poles) sets the mode; U routes the carrier's TX/SDA and RX/SCL lines.\n  Pads 1 and 6 end, silk 3V3 I2C (DIRECT):  VCC_C = +3V3, MODE = GND -> U connects TX/SDA to SDA and RX/SCL to SCL (slot bus).\n  Pads 3 and 4 end, silk 5V UART (PROXY):   VCC_C = +5V,  MODE = +5V -> U connects TX/SDA to MCU_RX and RX/SCL to MCU_TX (Nano UART).\nThe slider joins each common (2, 5) to the two throws at one end. The footprint puts pad 6 at pad 1's end and pad 4 at pad 3's end,\nso pin 6 (drawn beside pin 3) takes GND and pin 4 (drawn beside pin 1) takes +5V.\nThe carrier pulls its TX/SDA and RX/SCL up to its own VCC (4.7k), so in either position the slot bus never meets a 5 V carrier.\nR pulls MODE up: an open pole (mid-travel, failed contact) selects the UART side and keeps the carrier off the slot bus.\nMove SW with the Slice unpowered, after setting the EZO's protocol on the bench (I2C,n for direct; Baud,n for proxy)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f8de0e1-457a-46a7-81a9-425a0cc85574")
	)
	(text "EZO channel (CH1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "66789723-dcd0-4050-9226-31c6a0ec66f3")
	)
	(text "OFF: no pull-up here; the carrier pulls OFF up itself\n(Atlas: leave OFF unconnected when unused).\nDrive it open-drain from the Nano:\nOUTPUT LOW = carrier off, INPUT = carrier on.\nNever drive it high: a 5 V high would reach\na 3.3 V carrier in direct mode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "850939dc-86fa-4a97-9e3b-164d44c20f28")
	)
